			"notes": "Changes:\n - Added some error catching regarding certain actions of the Map ID Name Hashing/Remapping\n   - This might address some Network Protocol Errors happening in combination with [EvMod](https://modrinth.com/mod/evmod) and maybe even a full crash, but not sure as probably was not reproducible for me\n - For the same reason added an option to enable Debugging, so issues like these can hopefully get tracked down easier by others as well\n - Clarified some names as well to aid with troubleshooting\n - The fix ghost item feature now also targets banners, as they exhibit the same issue on 2b2t"
		},
