			"notes": "This release fixes maps on 2b by modifying received map ids and making them based on the name of the map.\n\nCare been taken to make sure same maps with different maps (or some maps with name, some without having the same map id) are not mixed up can cause missing maps. Also renaming in anvils should not cause the renamed map to be empty.\n\nUse this feature in combination with [Client Maps](https://modrinth.com/mod/client-maps) to take advantage of map caching and [Map In Slot](https://modrinth.com/mod/map-in-slot) to display them inside shulkers or bundles. Care has been taken to be compatible with Client Maps, might conflict with Rushers Caching (then just turn the feature off Mod settings).\n\n<img width=\"346\" height=\"397\" alt=\"grafik\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c76f5791-00fe-40af-bd59-806e4870bcb9\" />\n\n<img width=\"699\" height=\"367\" alt=\"grafik\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e0ec5a9-2a12-4a41-a1ac-3b1a5b6652f2\" />"
